WEBVTT

00:00:01.211 --> 00:00:02.169
[cheering]

00:00:03.692 --> 00:00:05.911
Inner peace. Inner peace.
Inner peace.
心静如水，心静如水，心静如水

00:00:06.085 --> 00:00:08.044
[exhales] Peace on.
静！

00:00:08.218 --> 00:00:10.220
- [Ping] Oh, Po?
- Peace!
阿宝？

00:00:10.394 --> 00:00:12.614
Oh, Po, I got you
a travel pack.
阿宝，我把你的行李准备好了

00:00:12.788 --> 00:00:16.008
I packed you food for weeks.
Cookies, buns, vegetables.
我给你准备了几个星期的干粮，饼干，
馒头

00:00:16.183 --> 00:00:19.098
I even packed all your
action figures. See?
菜，还带齐了你全部的公仔玩具，瞧？

00:00:19.273 --> 00:00:20.926
[guffaws]

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:23.755
Oh, uh... Hey,
I don't know what those are.
喔，不知道这是啥，从来没见过

00:00:23.929 --> 00:00:25.583
Never seen them before
in my life.
喔，不知道这是啥，从来没见过

00:00:25.757 --> 00:00:27.716
Dad, you got scratches
on my Tigress.
爹，你弄花了我的娇虎

00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:30.719
I also packed your paintings
of our best time together,
我还准备了咱们俩的父子情深画，
万一你觉得孤独

00:00:30.893 --> 00:00:33.417
just in case you get lonely.
我还准备了咱们俩的父子情深画，
万一你觉得孤独

00:00:33.591 --> 00:00:35.419
That's me and you
making noodles.
这是你和我在擀面，你和我在吃面

00:00:35.593 --> 00:00:37.465
And that's me and you
eating noodles.
这是你和我在擀面，你和我在吃面

00:00:37.639 --> 00:00:41.338
And that's me giving
you a piggyback ride.
那是我在背你

00:00:41.512 --> 00:00:44.602
Isn't that cute?
On second thought,
I'll hang on to this one.
可爱吧？我还是把这张留着

00:00:44.776 --> 00:00:46.691
Hey, uh...
they're waiting for me.
他们在等我

00:00:46.865 --> 00:00:50.347
Of course, of course.
You have a job to do...
当然了，你有重要事要办，远离家

00:00:50.521 --> 00:00:52.001
...far from home,
当然了，你有重要事要办，远离家

00:00:52.175 --> 00:00:54.264
in a strange city,
filled with strange people,
去陌生的地方，
认识陌生的人，吃陌生的面

00:00:54.438 --> 00:00:55.700
and strange noodles,
去陌生的地方，
认识陌生的人，吃陌生的面

00:00:55.874 --> 00:00:56.962
facing horrible danger
面对可能再也回不来的危险！
阿宝，别去了

00:00:57.136 --> 00:00:59.487
from which you
might never return!
面对可能再也回不来的危险！
阿宝，别去了

00:00:59.661 --> 00:01:00.923
Don't go, Po.
面对可能再也回不来的危险！
阿宝，别去了

00:01:01.097 --> 00:01:03.360
I gotta go.
I'm the Dragon Warrior.
我要去，我是龙武士，
拯救功夫是我的责任

00:01:03.534 --> 00:01:05.797
It's kind of my job
to save kung fu.
我要去，我是龙武士，
拯救功夫是我的责任

00:01:05.971 --> 00:01:08.931
And if I don't...
what am I?
我不去…算什么?

00:01:09.105 --> 00:01:11.107
You're my son.
你是我儿子

00:01:14.110 --> 00:01:15.111
Right?
对吧？

00:01:16.721 --> 00:01:19.594
- [Tigress] Po, it's time.
- Um, goodbye.
阿宝，到时候了

00:01:21.857 --> 00:01:23.337
Don't worry, Mr. Ping.
别担心平叔，不等您说‘捞面’他就回来了

00:01:23.511 --> 00:01:25.817
He'll be back
before you can say "noodles".
别担心平叔，不等您说‘捞面’他就回来了

00:01:31.519 --> 00:01:33.477
Noodles.
捞面

00:01:39.918 --> 00:01:41.790
Come on, guys, let's go!
快，我们走了

00:01:41.964 --> 00:01:43.139
Yeah!

00:01:45.141 --> 00:01:47.535
[panting and groaning]

00:01:47.709 --> 00:01:49.232
Yeah, yeah.

00:01:49.406 --> 00:01:50.451
Yeah...

00:02:04.334 --> 00:02:05.292
[Po] Oh!

00:02:06.380 --> 00:02:08.164
[Po grunting]

00:02:09.339 --> 00:02:11.515
[Po howling]

00:02:18.914 --> 00:02:20.698
[grunts] Ooh.

00:02:20.872 --> 00:02:23.527
[exhales and strains]

00:03:04.046 --> 00:03:05.700
[sighs]

00:03:06.570 --> 00:03:08.311
[chuckles]

00:03:10.052 --> 00:03:11.532
Mama?
娘？

00:03:16.972 --> 00:03:18.452
Mom? Dad?
娘？爹？

00:03:18.626 --> 00:03:19.757
Is that you?
是你吗？娘！爹！

00:03:19.931 --> 00:03:22.064
Mom! Dad!
是你吗？娘！爹！

00:03:23.979 --> 00:03:26.242
Oh, hi. Hey, son.
You're back.
儿子，你回来了

00:03:26.416 --> 00:03:27.852
Huh?

00:03:28.026 --> 00:03:29.767
Honey, what are you
doing here?
亲爱的，你在这儿做啥？

00:03:29.941 --> 00:03:31.552
But I thought...
但我以为…

00:03:31.726 --> 00:03:34.076
We've replaced you, dear,
with this lovely radish.
我们用小萝卜把你代替了

00:03:35.251 --> 00:03:36.295
Radish?
小萝卜？

00:03:36.470 --> 00:03:38.297
It's quiet, polite,
and frankly,
萝卜安静，有礼貌，而且功夫更高强

00:03:38.472 --> 00:03:40.474
does better kung fu.
萝卜安静，有礼貌，而且功夫更高强

00:03:40.648 --> 00:03:42.737
- [squeaks]
- No. No, no, no.
不对，不对

00:03:46.828 --> 00:03:48.786
Wait! [grunting]
等等!

00:03:51.354 --> 00:03:53.530
- [groans]
- [squeaks]

00:03:53.704 --> 00:03:55.663
- Hi-yah!
- No!

00:03:56.490 --> 00:03:57.665
[cries out]

00:04:03.671 --> 00:04:06.195
Radish, radish, radish.
小萝卜，小萝卜

00:04:06.369 --> 00:04:07.588
[growls] Yah!

00:04:14.856 --> 00:04:16.988
Inner pea... [grunts]
心静如…

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:21.384
Pea... [clears throat]

00:04:21.558 --> 00:04:22.864
P...

00:04:23.038 --> 00:04:24.474
Inner peace.
心静如水

00:04:24.648 --> 00:04:26.563
[dripping]
心静如水

00:04:26.737 --> 00:04:27.956
Aaah!

00:04:28.783 --> 00:04:30.785
[yells]

00:04:37.879 --> 00:04:40.882
[prolonged yell]

00:04:41.056 --> 00:04:45.669
Inner peace! Inner peace!
Inner peace! Inner peace,
inner peace...!
心静如水！心静如水！心静如水！

00:04:45.843 --> 00:04:47.279
[Tigress clears throat]

00:04:50.195 --> 00:04:53.764
Oh. Uh, I'm, uh, training.
我在，训练

00:04:53.938 --> 00:04:56.158
The mast is not
a worthy opponent.
旗杆算不上是对手

00:04:59.901 --> 00:05:02.251
- I am ready.
- OK.
我准备好了

00:05:02.425 --> 00:05:04.427
So serious.
好，这么严肃

00:05:05.689 --> 00:05:08.736
[impact echoes]

00:05:09.563 --> 00:05:11.782
Ha-ha-ow!

00:05:11.956 --> 00:05:14.959
- I think I prefer the mast.
- Apologies.
我还是用旗杆好了

00:05:15.133 --> 00:05:19.094
I used to punch the ironwood
trees by the palace to train.
抱歉，我是用捶打皇宫外的铁木树练出的

00:05:19.268 --> 00:05:20.574
Now I feel nothing.
现在我什么都感觉不到

00:05:21.618 --> 00:05:23.577
That's severely cool.
真够酷

00:05:26.536 --> 00:05:27.929
Again!
再来！

00:05:28.103 --> 00:05:29.931
Hah!

00:05:30.105 --> 00:05:33.064
So, uh, this
punching ironwood trees,
你用铁木树练功，练了多久啊？

00:05:33.238 --> 00:05:34.849
how long did you
have to do that?
你用铁木树练功，练了多久啊？

00:05:35.023 --> 00:05:38.243
- Twenty years.
- Oh. Twenty...
Twenty years? [groans]
喔，20年

00:05:38.417 --> 00:05:40.637
Is there any, uh,
you know, faster way?
有没有更快的方法？能练到没有感觉？

00:05:40.811 --> 00:05:43.466
You know, until you, uh,
you know...
don't feel anything?
有没有更快的方法？能练到没有感觉？

00:05:43.640 --> 00:05:44.598
No.
没有，再说…

00:05:44.772 --> 00:05:46.730
- Besides...
- [shouts]
没有，再说…

00:05:49.646 --> 00:05:52.562
I don't think hard style
is your thing.
我觉得硬功不是你的风格

00:05:53.563 --> 00:05:54.738
Oh.

00:05:57.132 --> 00:05:59.743
Po, why are you
really out here?
阿宝，你为什么要来？

00:06:01.136 --> 00:06:04.443
I just found out that
my dad... isn't really my dad.
我才发现我爹不是亲爹

00:06:06.576 --> 00:06:08.317
Your dad? The goose.
你爹？鹅叔

00:06:10.972 --> 00:06:13.235
That must have been
quite a shock.
你一定非常震惊喽

00:06:13.409 --> 00:06:15.324
Yeah.
是啊

00:06:15.498 --> 00:06:18.327
- And this bothers you?
- Are you kidding me?
你觉得不开心?

00:06:18.501 --> 00:06:21.504
We're warriors, right?
Nerves of steel.
开玩笑吧？我们都是战士吧？

00:06:21.678 --> 00:06:23.593
Souls of platinum.
铁打的神经，白金铸的灵魂，就像你

00:06:23.767 --> 00:06:25.029
Like you.
铁打的神经，白金铸的灵魂，就像你

00:06:25.203 --> 00:06:26.944
So hardcore you
don't feel anything.
硬如磐石，不觉得疼痛

00:06:27.118 --> 00:06:28.293
[chuckles] Yeargh!

00:06:28.467 --> 00:06:31.470
Yo. Wow.

00:06:31.645 --> 00:06:33.647
- I was...
- [Mantis] So, what are
you guys talking about?
我是… 你们在说什么呢？

00:06:34.604 --> 00:06:36.388
Nothing. Nothing.
没什么，没什么

00:06:36.563 --> 00:06:38.695
Po's having daddy issues.
阿宝跟他爹有点事

00:06:38.869 --> 00:06:42.046
I'm so lucky. I don't have
any problems with my dad.
我真幸运，跟爹爹没问题

00:06:42.220 --> 00:06:44.483
Maybe it's because Mom ate
his head before I was born.
也许因我没出世时娘就把它脑袋咬掉了，
不知道

00:06:44.658 --> 00:06:47.443
- I don't know.
- Mantis,
this isn't about you.
大刀螳，跟你没关系，阿宝快烦死了

00:06:47.617 --> 00:06:49.706
Po is the one freaking out.
大刀螳，跟你没关系，阿宝快烦死了

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:52.056
- I'm not freaking out.
- Po.
我没有要烦死

00:06:52.230 --> 00:06:54.406
- I'm freaking in.
- Po!
我其实挺滋润

00:06:54.581 --> 00:06:57.235
- What?
- We're here.
阿宝！ 什么？

00:06:57.409 --> 00:06:57.412
Gongmen City.

